    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d441">

                <pb facs="0806" n="678" sameAs="frus:frus1928v01/pg678"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.3412 Anti-War/1: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Bolivia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Kaufman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">La
                                Paz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-09-10T16:00:00-04:32"><hi rendition="#italic">September 10,
                                1928—4 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 4:05 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>41. The Bolivian Government through the Minister of Finance has requested me to
                    ask the Department to use its best course to obtain the adhesion of Paraguay to
                    the multilateral treaty for the renunciation of war,<anchor n="53"
                        xml:id="d441-f1"/> since the Bolivian Government thinks that such action
                    would facilitate the settlement of Bolivian-Paraguayan boundary question.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kaufman</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
